"url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#thresholds","content":"> 0.1%"},"6341":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-108","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#thresholds","content":"> 0.3%"},"6342":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-109","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#thresholds","content":"Delivery Failure Rate"},"6343":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-110","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#thresholds","content":"> 5%"},"6344":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-111","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#thresholds","content":"> 15%"},"6345":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-112","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#thresholds","content":"Score Drop (24h)"},"6346":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-113","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#thresholds","content":"> 15 points"},"6347":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-114","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#thresholds","content":"> 30 points"},"6348":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-115","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#auto-resolution","content":"Incidents automatically resolve when the triggering metric returns below its warning threshold. You do not need to manually close incidents. The resolution is noted in the incident history with a timestamp."},"6349":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-116","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-bounce-rate-is-high","content":"**Clean your contact list.** Remove addresses that have hard-bounced. NorthRelay automatically adds hard bounces to your suppression list."},"6350":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-117","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-bounce-rate-is-high","content":"**Use double opt-in.** Require email confirmation before adding contacts to your list."},"6351":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-118","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-bounce-rate-is-high","content":"**Validate emails at collection.** Use email syntax validation on signup forms."},"6352":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-119","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-bounce-rate-is-high","content":"**Remove inactive subscribers.** Contacts who have not engaged in 6+ months are more likely to become invalid."},"6353":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-120","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-spam-complaint-rate-is-high","content":"**Only send to opted-in recipients.** Never purchase email lists."},"6354":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-121","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-spam-complaint-rate-is-high","content":"**Include a visible unsubscribe link.** Make it easy to opt out -- this reduces complaints."},"6355":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-122","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-spam-complaint-rate-is-high","content":"**Set expectations at signup.** Tell subscribers what content they will receive and how often."},"6356":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-123","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-spam-complaint-rate-is-high","content":"**Honor unsubscribes immediately.** Process opt-outs within the same sending cycle."},"6357":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-124","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-spam-complaint-rate-is-high","content":"**Segment your audience.** Send relevant content to each group rather than blasting everyone."},"6358":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-125","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-delivery-failure-rate-is-high","content":"**Check your DNS configuration.** Use the Pre-Flight Check to validate SPF, DKIM, and DMARC records."},"6359":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-126","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-delivery-failure-rate-is-high","content":"**Verify your sending domain.** Unverified domains have lower trust with receivers."},"6360":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-127","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-delivery-failure-rate-is-high","content":"**Check the Blocklist Monitor.** Your IP or domain may be listed on a blocklist."},"6361":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-128","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-delivery-failure-rate-is-high","content":"**Reduce sending volume temporarily.** If you are being throttled, slow down and gradually ramp back up."},"6362":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-129","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-score-dropped-suddenly","content":"**Check for new incidents.** The incidents panel will tell you which metric triggered the drop."},"6363":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-130","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-score-dropped-suddenly","content":"**Review recent sending activity.** Did you send to a new or untested list?"},"6364":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-131","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-score-dropped-suddenly","content":"**Check for infrastructure issues.** Use the Connectivity Doctor to verify SMTP connectivity."},"6365":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-132","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#best-practices","content":"**Warm up new domains gradually.** Start with small volumes (100-500/day) and increase over 2-4 weeks."},"6366":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-133","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#best-practices","content":"**Monitor your dashboard weekly.** Catch trends before they become incidents."},"6367":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-134","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#best-practices","content":"**Keep bounce rate under 2%.** This is the industry standard for healthy sending."},"6368":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-135","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#best-practices","content":"**Keep complaint rate under 0.08%.** Gmail's threshold for filtering is 0.1%."},"6369":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-136","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#best-practices","content":"**Segment by engagement.** Send more frequently to engaged contacts, less to inactive ones."},"6370":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-137","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#best-practices","content":"**Authenticate everything.** SPF, DKIM, and DMARC should all pass for every email."},"6371":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-138","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#related","content":"Diagnostic Tools for troubleshooting delivery issues"},"6372":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-139","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#related","content":"Domain Verification for setting up proper authentication"},"6373":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-140","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#related","content":"Sending Infrastructure for how NorthRelay protects its sending IP"},"6374":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-141","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#related","content":"Plans & Pricing for tier-specific reputation features"},"6375":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","type":"page","content":"Sending Infrastructure","breadcrumbs":["NorthRelay Documentation","Features"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system"},"6376":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-0","page