leaves through a single sending relay:"},"6385":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-9","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#one-relay-for-everyone","content":"**Hostname**"},"6386":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-10","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#one-relay-for-everyone","content":"`sovereign.north-pipe.ca`"},"6387":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-11","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#one-relay-for-everyone","content":"**IPv4**"},"6388":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-12","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#one-relay-for-everyone","content":"`76.13.27.101`"},"6389":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-13","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#one-relay-for-everyone","content":"**HELO**"},"6390":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-14","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#one-relay-for-everyone","content":"`sovereign.north-pipe.ca`"},"6391":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-15","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#one-relay-for-everyone","content":"**SPF include**"},"6392":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-16","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#one-relay-for-everyone","content":"`include:_spf.north-pipe.ca`"},"6393":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-17","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#one-relay-for-everyone","content":"You connect to `smtp.north-pipe.ca` (or the REST API); NorthRelay queues your message and hands it to the relay, which signs it with DKIM and delivers it to the recipient's mail server. There is nothing to choose and nothing to configure — the path is the same for every account."},"6394":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-18","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#how-we-protect-its-reputation","content":"A single IP only works if it stays clean. These protections are enforced in code on every message:"},"6395":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-19","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#how-we-protect-its-reputation","content":"**Verified-From policy** — you can only send from a domain you have added and verified in your dashboard (or a subdomain of one). Requests from any other address are rejected with `403 FORBIDDEN_SENDER` and a message telling you which domain to verify. Nobody can spoof a domain they don't own."},"6396":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-20","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#how-we-protect-its-reputation","content":"**One-click unsubscribe** — every marketing and campaign message carries RFC 8058 `List-Unsubscribe` headers, so recipients can opt out with one click instead of reporting spam."},"6397":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-21","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#how-we-protect-its-reputation","content":"**Bounce and complaint suppression** — hard bounces and spam complaints are added to your suppression list automatically and never mailed again."},"6398":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-22","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#how-we-protect-its-reputation","content":"**Hourly delivery canary** — every hour NorthRelay sends a real message through the full sending path to a monitored mailbox and checks that it arrives with SPF, DKIM and DMARC passing. If it fails or goes stale, our team is alerted."},"6399":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-23","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#how-we-protect-its-reputation","content":"**Full authentication alignment** — the relay signs with DKIM for your verified domain, `include:_spf.north-pipe.ca` covers SPF for IPv4 and IPv6, and both align with DMARC. See DNS Setup."},"6400":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-24","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#what-changes-between-tiers","content":"Plans differ in limits and features, not in where your mail comes from:"},"6401":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-25","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#what-changes-between-tiers","content":"Tier"},"6402":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-26","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#what-changes-between-tiers","content":"Price"},"6403":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-27","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#what-changes-between-tiers","content":"Quota/Day"},"6404":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-28","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#what-changes-between-tiers","content":"Inbox cap"},"6405":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-29","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#what-changes-between-tiers","content":"Retention"},"6406":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-30","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#what-changes-between-tiers","content":"Features"},"64