tion","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/introduction#the-problem-with-unpoliced-shared-ips","content":"A sending IP is only as trustworthy as the least careful sender allowed on it. The fix is not to hide you on a different IP - it is to make sure nobody on the IP can behave badly."},"6603":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/introduction-11","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/introduction#how-northrelay-solves-it","content":"Every NorthRelay message leaves from **one protected sending IP**, and we treat its reputation as our job:"},"6604":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/introduction-12","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/introduction#how-northrelay-solves-it","content":"**Verified senders only** - you can only send from domains you have verified, so nobody can spoof a domain they don't own"},"6605":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/introduction-13","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/introduction#how-northrelay-solves-it","content":"**Automatic hygiene** - one-click unsubscribe on every campaign, plus automatic bounce and complaint suppression"},"6606":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/introduction-14","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/introduction#how-northrelay-solves-it","content":"**Monitored every hour** - a delivery canary confirms mail is arriving with SPF, DKIM and DMARC passing"},"6607":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/introduction-15","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/introduction#how-northrelay-solves-it","content":"Plans differ by quota and features, never by IP. See Sending Infrastructure for details."},"6608":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/introduction-16","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/introduction#key-features","content":"🚀 **Quick Setup** - Send emails in under 5 minutes"},"6609":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/introduction-17","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/introduction#key-features","content":"🛡️ **Protected Sending IP** - Verified senders only, monitored every hour"},"6610":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/introduction-18","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/introduction#key-features","content":"🔧 **Self-Service Tools** - Pre-Flight Check, Blocklist Monitor, Connectivity Doctor"},"6611":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/introduction-19","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/introduction#key-features","content":"📊 **Real-Time Analytics** - See delivery status, bounces, and reputation scores"},"6612":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/introduction-20","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/introduction#key-features","content":"🔐 **Enterprise Security** - TLS encryption, DKIM signing, DMARC compliance"},"6613":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/introduction-21","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/introduction#next-steps","content":"Installation Guide"},"6614":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/introduction-22","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/introduction#next-steps","content":"Send Your First Email"},"6615":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","type":"page","content":"Troubleshooting","breadcrumbs":["NorthRelay Documentation","Getting Started"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting"},"6616":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-0","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type"